161
00:10:50,921 --> 00:10:53,860
There's no storage, no freight stays.

162
00:10:53,861 --> 00:10:59,040
Our intent is to move product to our customers as quickly as possible.

163
00:10:59,041 --> 00:11:07,800
As each product approaches its intended pallet, the pallet loaders check, sort, and stack each box.

164
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:15,080
Associates at the end of these divert lanes will take those cartons, place them on store-specific pallets.

165
00:11:15,780 --> 00:11:20,580
The pallets are full, they're wrapped, and immediately loaded on trucks to go out to our stores.

166
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:25,920
The RDC supply and distribution system is so efficient that, on average,

167
00:11:25,921 --> 00:11:29,420
a product spends less than 25 minutes inside the facility.

168
